<title>POLAND: Paged Q1 net rises to PLN 1.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Paged Q1 net rises to PLN 1.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paged preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.89 vs	1.50</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.91 vs	2.53</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.70 vs	1.65</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Paged SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 27.17 vs     24.71</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  25.57 vs     14.08</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   1.33 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.21 vs	0.88</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.93 vs	6.52</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.54 vs	5.48</p>
<p>    investment				 0.15 vs	0.81</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
